window.products.push({"id":1094006,"name":"Magic Moon Mirror Decor, Round Wall Makeup Mirror with 3 Brightness LED Lights and 3 Effect Mode, Standing or Wall-Mounted, Living Room Bathroom Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YcFRgFpCS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Mirror and Light: Turn off the light, it is a black minimalist makeup mirror; turn on the light, it is a romantic mercury. It is a best decoration where art and beauty coexist. The surface is a simulated mercury with clear details, which can create a romantic atmosphere. 3 Color Lighting: The light uses three different moonlight color designs, namely white light, yellow light and warm light, which can give you different emotions under different light color atmospheres. Choose the one you like and enjoy. Press the USB controller switch to easily change the color and brightness of the light. Premium Material & Innovative Craft: Our mercury mirror is made of solid wood frame and HD Glass. Authentically detailed 3-D lunar landscape is made of solid wood carving and UV printing process, fully reflects the real appearance of the mercury, you will feel the luminous mercury beside to you. Strong simulated effect makes the bedroom more appealing and attractive. Enchanting Room Decor: Take the mercury to your room, the realistic moon lamp hanging on the wall or put on the table, the mercury comes to life in your room with soft light and authentic detail. This magic mercury lamp can be used as a romantic night lamp and indoor art decoration light for the adults, also be used as a ambient lighting for bedroom, living room, hotels, salons, beauty parlors, spas, and gyms. Two Ways of Installation: This luminous mirror can be wall-mounted and standing on the table. There is a keyhole on the back of mirror, please ensure to hang properly for safety; Also there is a bracket on the back, so it could also stand on the table. It is powered by USB with power cable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YcFRgFpCS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keledz","source_asin":"B09PD7BVBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PD7BVBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PD7BVBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094007,"name":"Laventy Set of 2 Tying the Knot Banner Nautical Bachelorette Banner Nautical Bachelorette Balloons Nautical Engagement Party Decor Nautical Bridal Ban","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-vmm+9YtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This listing is for \"tying the knot with anchors\" Banner which is perfect for any occasion! The banner letters are 4-7 inches tall. ALL LOWERCASE LETTERS - The banner is made out of sparkling glitter card stock and the back is white. The banner will come with string of your choice and letters are Pre-cut holes to string the banner. Having a Nautical themed Wedding, Bridal shower or engagement party? Here is a perfect banner and garland to add that personal touch!! This 'Tying the Knot' bunting would make a great addition to your bridal shower decor or a great photo prop for wedding/engagement photos!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-vmm+9YtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaVenty","source_asin":"B07WN6GZWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WN6GZWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WN6GZWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
