window.products.push({"id":1094011,"name":"Decodyne Designer Drinking Glasses 16 Ounce - Made of Durable Lead Free Glass - Decorative Highball Drinking Tumblers, Set of 6 (Gold Rimmed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814pfZjK3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Designer Drinking Glasses When you have company coming over for the holidays, a dinner party or just a nice get together, you do not want to give them their drinks in standard drinking glasses that you use every day. Your guests should feel special and cared for when they turn up to your home for a night of friendly conversation; a special occasion calls for a special set of drinking glasses, and with the Decorative Designer 16 Ounce Drinking Tumblers, you can get a set of designer tall drinking glasses with beautiful decorations that will delight your guests with their unique, sophisticated nature. The Decorative Designer 16 Ounce Drinking Glasses come in sets of six so that you can be sure you always have enough to go around. This size is perfect for a small to medium sized dinner, or you can purchase the sets in larger amounts in order to accommodate a larger dinner party. However many you choose, you can be sure that your guests will be pleased with the table arrangement that you have set for them with these stylish glasses included. The Decorative Designer 16 Ounce Drinking Glasses are made out of durable glass that is built to withstand many years of use. Each of these Decorative Designer 16 Ounce Drinking Glasses are able to hold up to 16 ounces of water or other liquid at one time, ensuring that everyone will have enough to drink. Available in three beautiful designs, you have plenty of options to choose from to suit your unique tablescape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814pfZjK3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decodyne","source_asin":"B076P3H4SP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076P3H4SP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076P3H4SP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094012,"name":"Movie Poster The Thing (1982) 24x36","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kTeurYLjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a professional quality reproduction poster. Item is 24x36 inches. This is an industry standard reproduction print 44lb. 165gsm 7mil gloss. Please check the photo prior to purchasing. With some of the older and rarer prints, signs of wear may be found on the original that will then carry over to the reproduction you will receive. This was done by the manufacturer to preserve the integrity of the original item. So please make sure you approve the image you are buying before committing to the purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kTeurYLjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Movie Poster","source_asin":"B00KSIP914","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KSIP914","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KSIP914","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094013,"name":"Metal Cocktail Napkin Holder With Acanthus Leaf Motif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ExrQB1GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Even a strong wind won't have you chasing paper napkins around your patio if you use this ornately embellishd box to hold them. Fit classic white or prettily printed paper towels in this 5.75-inch square intricate metal napkin holder Set this at the end of your buffet table for a classically elagant touch to even a casual meal For best results and to prolong use, hand wash the vintage inspired metalwork of this napklinl holder in mild soap and dry with a soft cloth Charming \"Old World\" European styling is seen in the elaborately scrolled openwork cast metal Acanthus Leaf pattern adorning the sides of this beautiful box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ExrQB1GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GG Collection","source_asin":"B00JDTXZAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JDTXZAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JDTXZAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094014,"name":"Home Sweet Home Dreams Inc Hotel Luxurious, 1800 Series Super Soft Embroidery 4 PC Sheet Set (Queen Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126BlPQvhL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a cool and comfortable night sleep with exceptionally breathable sheets that have a silky soft feel and a lustrous finish. These sheets provide a lasting vibrancy of color no matter how often they are washed and are made of high strength micro fiber yarns that will stay soft silky and wrinkle free for years - Soft to the touch, easy care No ironing necessary - Deep Pocket Sheets for oversize mattress. Set includes: One (1) flat sheet, One (1) fitted sheet, Two (2) pillowcases (One (1) in Twin sets) Fitted Sheet Pocket Depth: 16 Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126BlPQvhL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Sweet Home Dreams Inc","source_asin":"B00VKPRMYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VKPRMYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VKPRMYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094015,"name":"WOOD 4 SHELF ROLLING SIDE STORAGE TABLE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cTEPvDF+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Discover the versatile end table that fulfills almost ant storage need in a home or office. This space saving design has 4 storage shelves; one for display and 3 with lips for minimizing clutter and securing items. Use for organization or as a portable workstation. Casters (included) offer maneuverability. Come re-assembled. Wood. Measures 18 1/2\"L x 13 1/2\"W x 24\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cTEPvDF+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROLLING TABLES","source_asin":"B008X69B1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008X69B1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008X69B1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094016,"name":"Italian Hand Crafted Inlaid Light Burl Wood Musical Jewelry Box Plays Let Me Call You Sweetheart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818excm8h9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is the highest quality musical jewelry box available. It is handmade in Italy with skills and techniques that date back to the 7th century. It is hand inlaid and made of natural wood. The feet are made of brass. The music mechanism is the highest quality Sankyo music available. It includes a brass key with red tassel to lock and keep safe jewelry or other valuable items. The music mechanism can be seen playing on the inside of the box when you lift the cover. The inside is covered in rich velvet lining. Everything about this music box is of the highest quality.In modern times, the range of woods has grown to include walnut briar, ebony, maple, poplar, elm, bobbing, palisander, etc. The manufacturing still remains hand based with the help of modern tools, such as the double-ended cross cut saw. The typical shading intricacy of the design is achieved with the aid of red-hot sanding. This operation, which must be executed with immense care, gives warm and elegant nuances to the beautiful tones of the wood itself. The wood passes through stages of smoothing and polishing to yield exquisite high gloss, or elegant matte finishes. These phases involve manual work with endless grain variations, such that essentially no two pieces are alike, which is an important feature of Sorrento inlaid woodwork.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818excm8h9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Splendid Music Box Co.","source_asin":"B07VNHHCWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNHHCWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNHHCWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
