window.products.push({"id":1094020,"name":"Kitchen Compost Bin with Charcoal Filters - Sustainable Bamboo Fiber Countertop Food Composter - Indoor Compost Bucket - Trash Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBfT2HQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃 IDEAL COMPOSTER: Let you convert your own organic waste into compost to enrich the soil in your backyard or garden. Perfectly sized for kitchen countertop. 🍃 BAMBOO FIBER: Our composter bin is made of biodegradable, dishwasher safe, durable bamboo fiber. Made of high-quality materials -- will never leach chemicals into your compost. 🍃 BE SUSTAINABLE: Using of the most eco-friendly fabric on the planet, help us to save our planet. 🍃 CONTROL ODORS NATURALLY: The airtight lid and replaceable activated-charcoal filter work together to trap and control odors. Thus, your kitchen compost bin can sit conveniently on your countertop or wherever you need it. Charcoal filter lifetime is about 2 months. 🍃 COMPACT: 7 x 7 x 9 in 🍃 DISHWASHER SAFE 🍃 MICROWAVE UNSUITABLE 🍃 CHARCOAL FILTERS x 2 pcs. replaceable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBfT2HQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTHYS","source_asin":"B0BGJR72LN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGJR72LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGJR72LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
