window.products.push({"id":1094038,"name":"S&T 429900 Microfiber Dish Drying Mat, 16 by 18-Inch, Tan Damask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWqVYsssL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The S&T Microfiber Dish Drying Mat is the new solution to the age old tradition of placing dish towels on the counter when hand-washing pots, pans, dishes and glassware. Often imitated, but never duplicated, our Dish Drying Mat features a center layer of foam that is fused to revolutionary, super-absorbent microfiber fabric using our proprietary manufacturing process. This process yields a mat that is highly functional and incredibly durable, use after use, wash after wash. By combining an optimal foam thickness with uniquely woven microfiber fabric, water quickly radiates from the point of contact, enhancing absorption and quickening drying time. You will be amazed by the effectiveness and convenience of this deceptively simple item! The S&T Microfiber Dish Drying Mat is perfect for use underneath a dish rack to catch drips or you can place pots, pans and glassware directly on the mat. You can even set it under small appliances to protect your counter from scratches and scuffs. It's available in a variety of colors and prints to compliment your personal style. Caring for your Dish Drying Mat is easy; simply toss it in the washing machine with cold water and a liquid detergent and then place in the dryer on a low heat setting. The Dish Drying Mat is just one of the many impressive items offered by S&T. Designed to make it easier to take care of the home, our innovative, high-value and superior-quality products provide cleaning, kitchen, bath, laundry and pet solutions to solve life's little dilemmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWqVYsssL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S&T INC.","source_asin":"B0169QX7ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0169QX7ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0169QX7ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094039,"name":"DK.AMZ Bookshelf 3-Tier Shelf,Bookcase Book Storage Plant Stand Rack Freestanding Floor for Home Bathroom,Living Room, Kitchen,Easy to Assemble, Natur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E85tZmhyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📕【3-Tier Multipurpose Book Shelf】Elegant and simple bookshelf with rattan elements and triple density board shelves.The steps get wider from top to bottom, offering plenty of space for creativity.Various kinds of stuffs, such as decorative plants, photos, books, knickknacks, can get their position easily. This item is definitely your best choice. 📕【Minimalist Bookcase】Complete your home or office decor with this elegant Natural bookcase, bringing your space a warm feeling.Whether you're in a dorm room, apartment, condo, house, or office the classic silhouette and functional design of this 3-Tier ladder shelf will match your surrounding, furniture, and style seamlessly. 📕【Stable & Sturdy Storage Organizer】The 3-Tier ladder shelf is made of solid density board frame, which ensures sturdy and durable. And stability can also be guaranteed due to its ladder-like shape and flexible settings ensuring the overall sturdiness of this bookcase. It is enough to meet your daily needs. It can serve you for a long time. 📕【Keep Tt Clean And Tidy At All Times】The surface of solid wood bamboo is coated with waterproof varnish to makes it delicate and smooth. So the bookshelf is moist-resistant and won't get dirty easily, it is very easy for you to maintain it. In order to prolong the service life, please avoid prolonged use in a high humidity environment. 🔨【Hassle-Free Assembly】All assembling parts and step-to-step instructions are included for you to finish the assembly in minutes. Overall dimensions 15”L X 12”D X 38”H with net weight 11 LBS. This ladder shelf boasts a great bearing capacity of 22 lb per level and expertly maximizes space for all your storage essentials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E85tZmhyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DK.AMZ","source_asin":"B09GXSV6BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXSV6BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXSV6BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
