window.products.push({"id":1094514,"name":"MABARA Decorative Books – 3-Pcs Set New York, Miami, Los Angeles Coffee Table Books – Decorative Books for Living Room, Home Decor, Coffee Table, Book","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fqe5AvNzL._AC_SL1079_.jpg","description":"MABARA focuses on providing modern and chic decor accessories meant to transform your home into a sanctuary of good vibes, warmth and peace, where you can feel welcome and surrounded by love. We use only high-quality materials and creative designs to deliver versatile decorations and ornaments that will enhance your home decor and create a modern ambiance with a sophisticated twist. Should you not be entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department is at your disposal and will address any issues or concerns!  Decorative Books for a Modern Home and a Touch of Joy  Whether you are a travel lover, you are passionate about interior designs or simply looking for new decorations to make your home look spectacular, our decorative books for coffee table are the ideal choice! The decorative book set comprises 3 books inspired by 3 of the most famous American cities, New York, Los Angeles, and Miami that will add a fashionable touch to your bedroom, coffee table, bookshelf, or office. Unlike other similar products, these decor books feature a hardcover design with blank pages on the interior where you can attach photos, memories, or sketches and create a unique scrapbook of all your adventures.  Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:  Set of 3 decorative books with New York, Los Angeles, and Miami; High-quality materials; Real hardcover books with blank pages on the interior; Perfect as decorations, table centerpieces, decor accents for the coffee table, bookshelf, side table, bedroom, living room, office, entryway; Blend in beautifully into any decor; Can be used as scrapbooks or journals where you can attach pictures, photographs, newspaper cuts, memories, and more; Lovely gift for friends and family; Elegant packaging; Dimensions: 9.5 x 6.5 x 1.0-inch;  Your home will look simply gorgeous with our decorative display books!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fqe5AvNzL._AC_SL1079_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MABARA","source_asin":"B09XBMQXSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBMQXSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBMQXSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
