window.products.push({"id":1094525,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, Mug Warmer for Desk, Portable Thermostatic Electric Mug Warmer- 3-Temp Settings & 4H Auto Shut Off Cup Warmer for Coffee, Beverage,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MSbT8zQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4H Auto Shut-Off Coffee Warmer】- Our coffee warmer for desk auto shut off, coffee mug warmer will automatically turn off after 4 hours of work, Super slim stylish design, Keep the beverages warm all day. It will be the best Birthday gift, Thanksgiving and Christmas Gift, and other special occasions to show you care.(The cup not included.) 【3-Temp Settings Electric Coffee Warmer】- The desk coffee warmer, different colors displayed by the power button represent different temperatures. Blue: low-temp 105°F-120°F, Purple: mid-temp 130℉-150℉, Red: high-temp 160℉-180℉. Choose the right temperature freely according to your needs. 【Waterproof Mug Warmer】- This coffee mug warmer for desk comes with a waterproof conductive glass surface, so there is no need to worry about the safety of occasional spills, coffee cup heater is safe and easy to clean. 5.2\" oversized heating area can heat up coffee faster and evenly, just enjoy fragrant coffee without waiting. 【36W Cup Warmer with An Enlarged Heating Plate】- Coffee cup warmers electric. To make the coffee cup warmer fit more cups, the diameter of the heating plate was lengthened to 5.2 inches. With a flat glass surface design, this cup warmer plate is suitable for flat tableware, stainless steel cup, mug, milk box, glass cup and etc. We suggest using steel flat and thin bottom mug for the best results rather than a mug with deep concave bottom. 【Drink Warmer for Desk】- Coffe mug warmer, electric cup warmer electric beverage warmer. Easy to clean and no need for security concern for occasional spill, vents at the bottom of the mug warmer - protect the circuit and extend the life of the mug warmer, Silicone anti-skid pad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MSbT8zQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WACAR","source_asin":"B0BNX5TVBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNX5TVBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNX5TVBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
