window.products.push({"id":1094613,"name":"ROCOCO 2lb Dragon Butcher Knife Heavey Duty Cleaver Knife for Meat Bone Cutting 9.5\" Cool Big Viking Camping Chopper Cutter with Sheath Father Day Bir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mgQTwkGWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Heavy Duty Bone Cleaver】The tough steel and thick and heavy blade of this bone chopper is suitable for chopping bones such as pork, ribs, beef, and poultry, and for cutting through the tough, dense connective tissue of joints. 2lb weight delivers power chops with blunt force. The dragon cleaver knife excels at all kinds of basic cutting tasks like chopping, mincing, slicing, and dicing. 【Unique Dragon Carving 】 Laser carved pattern on blade will never fade. Metal aging process gives the viking knife a retro style.With improved craftsmanship, even the dragon scales are exquisitely clear. The brass material of forged butcher knife reflects the texture of the meat cleaver. The full tang design through the whole knife is strong and durable. 【Excellent Craftsmanship】The blade and cutting edge of meat cutting knife is made of high carbon steel(7Cr17MOV),tough and resilient enough to withstand the punishment of repeated impact with cartilage, thick cuts of meat, bone, and the cutting board. Thousand times of forging gives birth to tough resilience and excellent edge retention of meat cleaver knife heavy duty. 【Portable & Durable】The fine leather sheath plays a role in protecting the blade and offers a chance to take the bone cutting knife along on each outdoor journey. Good weight distribution makes the meat cleaver knife more dynamic. Ergonomic contours provide a firm, comfortable, non-slip grip. The engraved pattern on the handle rightly increases the friction. 【Gift Idea】The meat cleaver will be an ideal gift for your butcher chef friends, family members,hunting or bbq lovers on Christmas, birthday, housewarming, Thanksgiving, Father Day. The unique design brings a brand new style to kitchen. The bone knife is a perfect choice whether bought as a gift or for your own use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mgQTwkGWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROCOCO","source_asin":"B0BYH5ZJSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYH5ZJSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYH5ZJSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
