window.products.push({"id":1094708,"name":"LIKO HOME, Bonsai Copper Wire Tree Light,with Remote Control8 Function6 Hrs Timer,BatteryUSB Operated Artificial Tree Lamp Perfect Decor for Home Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ESIzA-gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: LED quantity: 108 LED High:20 inch Supply voltage:4.5V USB power supply: requires adapter (not included) Quality Assurance: We will solve the problem for you within 24 hours If the decorative lights are damaged during transportation or use, please contact us in time. How To Install LED Tree Light 1. Turn on the LED tree light and take out the LED bonsai tree light from the package. 2. There is a small convex groove aligned with the base. After alignment , insert the base and turn left. 3. After installation, insert 3 AA batteries or supply power via USB(Please remove the USB cable when using batteries, or it will not light up!) 4. Turn on the switch/use remote control to complete the operation. Packing List: 1*Base 1*USB cable 1*Remote control 1*108 LED Bonsai tree lights Warm tips: ?Please avoid heavy or repeated styling to avoid breakage. ?If you do not use the product for a long time, please remove the battery. ?Please set all lighting effects before timing, otherwise the timing function setting will not succeed. ?The effective distance of the remote control is about 26 feet, and 8 different flashing modes (Combination,In wave,Sequential,Slo glo,Chasing/Flash,Slow fade,Twinkle/Flash,Steady on) ?The effect after timing is to automatically turn off after 6 hours, and automatically turn on after 18 hours, so as to cycle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ESIzA-gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIKO HOME","source_asin":"B08YDLXQLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDLXQLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDLXQLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094709,"name":"HOKEKM Knife Sharpener, 2 Stage Easy Manual Kitchen Chefs Pocket Survival Professional Sharpener with Non-Slip Suction Cup Helps Repair, Restore and P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScOoMvNWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 2 Swipes Turn Dull Knives Sharp - First, Coarse sharpening. Place knife on the first sharpening slot, using slight downward pressure, run the blade from its heel to its point through the slot. Repeat three to five times. And then, repeat the first step on the second sharpening slot to run the blade. ✅ Versatile & Easy use - Just 3 swipes with highly efficient knife blade sharpener make old knives cut like brand new - in seconds. IDEAL FOR chef's knife, butcher knife, hunting knife, pocket knife, and more. (everything except scissors and fine toothed knives) ✅ Time & Money Saver:Come with sharpening Guide. You will quickly and effectively repair knives.Get a razor sharp knife in seconds, knives will work like new.It's the perfect complement in most kitchens! Save the money of buying new set knife. ✅ Superior Sharpening Performance - The Diamond and CERAMIC abrasives pass 10,000 times field use test. NEVER WEARS OUT. Made with high quality materials, knives will work like new. ✅ Safety & Portability - We put the safety of our customers above all else. The humanized design of the bottom of the sharpener with a non-slip suction pad base can be steadily sucked on the smooth desktop and other places during operation. Effectively release your other hand to protect your hand from being scratched.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScOoMvNWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOKEKM","source_asin":"B09SNNT4QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SNNT4QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SNNT4QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
