window.products.push({"id":1094718,"name":"Nicole Kidman Artwork Plate for Whatever It Takes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I4+x5rCML._AC_.jpg","description":"Whatever it Takes / Churchill. Contained in a printed black box. When you open your presentation box, there is a nice color photo of the star and a facsimile signature. Please view the photo on this item. We have a design suggested by artwork from the star on a round plate, measuring 8\" across. This particular image shows a smiling, very thin lady, with lots of snazzy, zippy hair. She has her arms crossed and looks very bemused by it all. This is a numbered edition, with the words \"Make love not war.\" Each of these plates were offered so that individual stars could contribute to charitable projects around the world. In the case of Nicole Kidman, here she is supporting UNICEF. Box itself measures 8.5\" x 8.5\" x 2\" plus. A really different collectible piece.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I4+x5rCML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"21st Century Leaders","source_asin":"B001DE3P9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001DE3P9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001DE3P9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094719,"name":"Comvi Green Throw Pillows Decorative Pillows, Inserts & Covers (2 Throw Pillows + 2 Pillow Covers ) - Velvet Decorative Pillows for Bed - flanged Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QkUj32y-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NO MORE FLAT PILLOW: In a rare case due to long shipping and vacuumed packing, it may be possible that 1% pillow does not get fully fluffed shape. That’s OK, we have got an easy solution as you have Zipper insert. Kindly follow the following steps. > Open the zipper and remove all stuffing.> Pull apart all the lumps of stuffing with your hands > Start filling back the pillow, make sure to fill corner first.> Once all stuffing is back Zip it back> You have successfully fluffed your pillow SIZE OF COVER & INSERT: Throw Pillows inserts 20 x 20 inch & Throw Pillow covers 18 x 18 inch 20x20 Throw Pillows inner is little bigger in size so that insert can fit in perfectly and looks fluffy inside Throw Pillow covers 18 x 18 cm , Comvi Throw Pillows 18in x 18in fits best at sofa and bed. ZIPPER INSERT FOR EASY WASH: Comvi Throw Pillow pads have PP cotton filling of 500g, with 100% cotton pad cover and Zipper is available to make it adjustable Pillows for bed and sofa Pillows, You can easily remove stuffing and wash both insert and cover. Keep stuffing out of reach of children. In Centimeters its 50x50 Pillow insert and can fit well in Pillow covers 45x45 cm. GRADE A VELVET: Flanged Velvet Pillow covers are Grade A Velvet having very soft, cozy and give snug like feeling which make them perfect choice of decorative pillows for bed and beautiful choice for sofa and bed Pillows. Color: Comvi Pillows come with different colors, grey Pillow cover can be a part of your bed & living room, giving it luxury feeling. Throw Pillow covers grey can match excellent in home décor , bed décor and living room décor. Grey Pillows for sofa also can become a beautiful combination in your living room and comvi grey fluffy Pillows is a premium choice for this. Apart from grey comvi Pillows comes in Wine Red, Yellow, Orange Yellow, Pink Purple, Navy Blue MONEY BACK GURANTEE: 100% money back guarantee if you’re not completely satisfied, no fuss, no questions asked","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QkUj32y-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"comvii","source_asin":"B09T3LG6FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T3LG6FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T3LG6FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
