window.products.push({"id":1094867,"name":"Granitestone Non Stick Frying Pan Set, 9.5” & 5.5” Frying Pans Nonstick, Mini Egg Pan, Long Lasting Nonstick Frying Pans for Cooking, Stay Cool Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CYTXO1NtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everyday Frying Pan: Rely on this this frying pan for your everyday cooking needs for years on end- Stir fry foods, cook eggs, braise and sear meats, or anything else you’d like while the nonstick coating ensures an easy food release without oils or butters needed, while the gorgeous emerald color provides style to any kitchen. Mini Egg Pan: This set includes a 5.5” mini-Egg Pan designed to provide perfectly cooked eggs day in and day out. The unique aluminum composition heats quickly and evenly through, ensuring you get perfectly cooked eggs in just minutes every day. Long Lasting Nonstick: Think healthier foods, easy food release, and an effortless cleanup with the Granitestone non stick frying pan- This pan is triple coated with ultra-nonstick technology, preventing any foods or sticky sauces from sticking to your pan while cooking or frying for years to come. Quick and Easy Cleanup: The Granitestone non stick frying pan is designed for an effortless wipe down after using and is completely dishwasher safe, allowing you to simply throw the frying pan in the dishwasher for a quick 1,2,3 cleanup. 100% Healthy & Toxin Free: Comprised from a mineral based coating, this frying pan is completely free of PFOA, PFOS, lead, cadmium, or any harmful chemicals, ensuring your kitchen stays completely toxin free and ecofriendly. Durable & Lasting: Built to last years, each frying pan is triple coated, infused with minerals and diamonds, and avoids any heat induced warping when heated to extremely high temperatures, ensuring you will receive years of outstanding usage. Stovetop & Oven Safe: The Frying Pan is oven safe up to 500 degrees and compatible with all types of stovetops - Gas, electric, halogen, & ceramic, besides induction, allowing you to cook virtually anywhere you’d like. Evenly Cooked Meals: Created from a single, stamped aluminum plate, the frying pan quickly and evenly conducts heat from end to end, ensuring there are no dead spots or hot zones, perfectly cooking foods day in and day out. Metal Utensil Safe: Granitestone cookware is infused with diamond particles durable enough to withstand any metal utensils, whisks, spatulas, and even electric eggbeaters, ensuring your frying pan will last years. 10 Year Guarantee: Granitestone cookware is built to provide years of outstanding use and is backed by a 10-year limited guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CYTXO1NtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granitestone","source_asin":"B09KSCZRLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KSCZRLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KSCZRLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
