window.products.push({"id":1094983,"name":"Greens Steel Premium Stainless Steel Cups 10oz (4Pack) and 16oz (4Pack) Bundle - Durable Stackable BPA Free Metal Cups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwwzD0PzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👶 GREAT FOR KIDS – Are you looking for that perfect set of cups for your kids?? We were too, but couldn’t find anything! That’s why we created the Greens Steel Stainless Steel Cups. We've cut no corners, using only the Highest Quality Premium 304 18/8 Food Grade Stainless Steel. Our Kids love them and we know yours will too! This bundle offers unrivaled value for money. It comes with a total of 8 stainless steel cups - 10oz x 4 and 16oz x 4. ⭐ SUPERIOR FINISHING INSIDE & OUT - Brushed outer finsih giving them a smooth exterior & electro-polished on the inside so your cups remain pure and rust-free! Imparting NO nasty metallic taste or unwanted flavors. Clean tasting drinks every time. ✅ EASY TO USE STORE AND CLEAN - Stackable for easy storage and portability! Light weight, and the perfect size for kids hands allows safe and easy drinking. Unbreakable, rust proof, and Dishwasher safe! ♻ HEALTHY, SAFE & ENVIRO-FRIENDLY - No nasties guaranteed. BPA Free, Phthalate-free, Lead and Toxin-Free. Our cups are always environmentally friendly and completely recyclable (including packaging). Keep it clean! Keep it Green! ✔ LIFETIME GUARANTEE & 100% SATISFACTION - Yes! All Greens Steel Products come with a LIFETIME GUARANTEE! 100% Satisfaction or your money back. Order now and put us to the test! Don't settle for any less.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwwzD0PzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greens Steel","source_asin":"B0876FGM2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0876FGM2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0876FGM2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1094984,"name":"Quiqear Bamboo Shoe Rack, 3 Tier Shoe Rack Organizer, Stackable & Durable Shoe Shelf Holder, Free Standing Shoe Racks, Shoe Storage Organizer for Entr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hg3fuAfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY BAMBOO MATERIAL: The shoe stand is made of eco-friendly bamboo material. Quiqear only uses moso bamboo with a lifespan of more than 8 years, which has the characteristics of high density, strong toughness and regeneration. Bamboo shoe racks can store carbon stably and avoid rapid release into nature, making a certain contribution to slowing down global climate change. UPGRADED SIZE:The width of each layer of 27.2 inches can accommodate 3 pairs of adult shoes. After the upgrade, the height of each floor reaches 6.8 inches.You can store all your canvas shoes, high-heeled shoes, sports shoes, slippers neatly on the shoe rack organizer, and only place them in strips, so that the home will not look like cluttered, but also convenient for you to choose your favorite shoes before going out. FLEXIBLE STACKING COMBINATION:Perfect mortise design, different from other fixed shoe racks in the market, our shoe organizer is composed of 1-tier shoe rack and 2-tier shoe rack stacking, which can be freely combined and matched. 2 racks After stacking, you can get a large storage 3 tier shoe rack, use the 2-tier rack shelf separately to store shoes, and the 4-tier rack shelf can be put into the large wardrobe as a closet shelf organizer or baby shoe organizer for storing baby shoes and toys. MULTIFUNCTIONAL STORAGE RACK:This bamboo shelf can be used in porch, wardrobe, living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, study room, balcony, etc. It is lightweight, convenient and easy to move. The rack shelf can not only be used as a shoe rack for door, but also can be used as a wardrobe rack, flower pot rack, kitchen rack, bookshelf, bathroom rack, etc. According to your different needs to place your different items, it is a multifunctional small storage rack. FUN ASSEMBLY:The shoe organizer includes product installation instructions and the required operating tools, and you can assemble the shoe storage independently within 13 minutes. The middle link of the shoe shelf partition adopts the link buckle of the same color, which increases the interest in the simple assembly process and strengthens the stability of the rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hg3fuAfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"quiqear","source_asin":"B09XGPT793","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGPT793","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGPT793","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
