window.products.push({"id":1094995,"name":"Aston & Arden Aegean Ombre Bath Towels - (Pack of 2) Oversized Ultra Soft Thick & Absorbent, 100% Ringspun Turkish Cotton Bathroom Towel for Spa, Hote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617JuwRMDFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTRA SOFT AND LUXE TURKISH TOWELS: These luxurious 5-Star Hotel quality towels are made from the finest 100% Turkish cotton from the Aegean region of Turkey. Aegean cotton grows with a long staple fiber preferred by fine textile makers for spinning into yarns. The result is a stronger, smoother, and softer cotton yarn. AEGEAN TURKISH COTTON: You'll love the feel of these heavier than most Turkish towels for their supreme comfort, high absorbency, and master craftsmanship. We took no shortcuts with this Turkish towel set. We refused to compromise on quality and designed luxury towels to captivate a discerning clientele. OVERSIZED AND THICK TURKISH TOWELS: All of our Turkish towels are oversized and thicker than others in the market. Made in Turkey from long-staple Aegean cotton, this collection features a delicate ombre gradient-striped dobby border on a pristine white terry body. COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: The ombre dobby border draws from seaside earth tones, water, and sky including colors - Sand, Slate Grey, Rose, Sage Green, Pewter Grey and Crystal Blue. This collection makes a bold bath decor statement with a unique ombre striped dobby border adorning a brilliant white terry body. SUPERIOR RINGSPUN COTTON: Ringspun cotton is made through an innovative spinning process that’s designed to thoroughly soften and straighten each fiber. These towels feature a low-twist ringspun combed cotton, which creates a more voluminous and plush textile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617JuwRMDFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B09ZVFSLLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1094995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZVFSLLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZVFSLLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
